WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Build and backtest strategies,
with a copilot and paper-trading workflow.

00:16.000 --> 00:25.000
The engine models trading costs,
uses closed bars, and checks risk limits.

00:25.000 --> 00:33.000
One reference strategy illustrates a run;
reported results include modeled costs.

00:33.000 --> 00:42.000
Decisions read closed bars;
market orders fill at the next bar's open.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
Backtesting, an AI strategy copilot,
and charts using delayed market data.

00:48.000 --> 00:55.000
A visual strategy builder; paper trading
reuses the backtest engine.

00:55.000 --> 01:03.240
Commission and slippage are on by default.
Decimal accounting; hypothetical returns.
